			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T11:59:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あたしも　一年前
アララギ博士から　ポケモンを▽
託されて　旅に　でたんだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
